    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5419" root="جرأ" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُرْأَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Boldness, daringness, bravery,</i> or <i>courage;</i>
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُرَةٌ</span>: (S: see 1:) the <i>quality of venturing</i>
upon a saying [&amp;c.] <i>hastily and unhesitatingly.</i>
(Msb.)

